        <title type="html"><![CDATA[bump @npmcli/eslint-config peer deps]]></title>
        <id>https://github.com/npm/statusboard/issues/1107</id>
        <link href="https://github.com/npm/statusboard/issues/1107"/>
        <updated>2026-06-21T08:16:41.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/332363?u=9d22fb4cf5db8982204ada277d3f997ad998c6f8&v=4" width="64" height="64" alt=""/><br/><p dir="auto">The peer deps in <code class="notranslate">@npmcli/eslint-config</code> are a couple majors behind:</p>
<ul dir="auto">
<li><code class="notranslate">eslint</code> <code class="notranslate">^8.13.0</code> -&gt; 10.x</li>
<li><code class="notranslate">eslint-plugin-node</code> <code class="notranslate">^11.1.0</code> -&gt; deprecated, swap to <code class="notranslate">eslint-plugin-n</code> 18.x</li>
<li><code class="notranslate">eslint-plugin-promise</code> <code class="notranslate">^6.0.0</code> -&gt; 7.x</li>
</ul>
<p dir="auto">eslint 10 dropped legacy <code class="notranslate">.eslintrc</code> so this also means moving <code class="notranslate">lib/index.js</code> and the repo's own <code class="notranslate">.eslintrc.js</code> to flat config.</p>
<ul dir="auto">
<li><a href="https://github.com/npm/eslint-config/blob/main/package.json">https://github.com/npm/eslint-config/blob/main/package.json</a></li>
</ul>]]></content>
